WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.667
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.667
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.208
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.125
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:28.833
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.708
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:32.542
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:35.542
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.667
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.458
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:02.875
I-I don't know who you are...

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:07.125
But please, help me.

00:02:49.583 --> 00:02:51.500
"The One Behind the Forest Fire"

00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:56.542
Geez. Another bounty?

00:02:56.542 --> 00:02:59.167
We haven't been turning in
anything lately, huh?

00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:01.375
No, we haven't.

00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:05.625
We're slaying demons left and right,
but we never get their heads!

00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:07.667
Why do you have a debt in the first place?

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:10.375
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
That's because of that master.

00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:11.375
SETSUNA          TOWA HIGURASHI
Master?

00:03:16.208 --> 00:03:17.833
Oh, sorry about that.

00:03:21.792 --> 00:03:22.708
I'll cut it!

00:03:22.708 --> 00:03:24.208
Whoa, wait.

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.000
What is that?

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.083
A smart phone. Didn't you see me using it
when we were over in the other world?

00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:32.542
Were you now? I don't remember.

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:35.458
On top of being a phone,
you can check the time or email,

00:03:35.917 --> 00:03:38.625
take pictures and video,
search the Web, check your socials...

00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:41.917
There are also other apps
you can install on it,

00:03:41.917 --> 00:03:44.208
and over there it was a necessary item.

00:03:44.792 --> 00:03:48.250
Of course, with no signal here
there's no point in having this,

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.208
But I just can't seem to let go of it.

00:03:51.583 --> 00:03:53.500
An item you can't let go...

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.750
I don't really understand.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.000
Hey, wait a minute.
I have something like that, too.

00:03:59.417 --> 00:04:02.875
See? The Kappa foot
that Grandpa Higurashi gave me.

00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:05.542
Huh...?

00:04:05.542 --> 00:04:06.833
CORPSE DEALER
Hey, Mr. Jyubei, we're here.

00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:08.958
Hey, Mr. Jyubei, we're here.

00:04:13.625 --> 00:04:15.167
Are you all right?

00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:20.292
Sorry, I got the wrong house!

00:04:20.292 --> 00:04:21.417
What's wrong?

00:04:21.417 --> 00:04:23.750
There was this really pretty person, and...

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.167
Pretty person?

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:27.167
Hello.

00:04:27.542 --> 00:04:30.542
BEAUTIFUL VILLAGE GIRL – TAMANO

00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:34.250
Oh, hi.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.208
See? Isn't it strange for someone
so beautiful to be here?

00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:39.250
CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
Just drop it.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.958
We got a wonderful job
from our very special client.

00:04:42.958 --> 00:04:46.167
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU
So we meet again, dear princess.

00:04:46.167 --> 00:04:47.375
Riku?

00:04:47.375 --> 00:04:48.333
That guy...

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:52.458
RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO
Hey, all of you! Be more respectful!

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:57.458
Well, it's not really a job coming from me,
but rather a request from this person.

00:04:57.792 --> 00:05:00.958
It's nice to meet you,
my name is Tamano.

00:05:01.333 --> 00:05:03.167
Miss Tamano.

00:05:03.167 --> 00:05:08.250
Miss Tamano escaped from Homura,
an evil god from the Northern mountains.

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.708
An evil mountain god...

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:10.750
Homura?

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:11.875
Yes.

00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:16.458
Homura and I lived alone in a mansion
in the Northern snowy mountains.

00:05:16.625 --> 00:05:19.917
Does that mean you and Homura
were husband and wife?

00:05:19.917 --> 00:05:20.958
No.

00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:24.750
Well, even if you don't think so,

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.500
Homura probably thought
that you two were married.

00:05:29.542 --> 00:05:30.750
What do you mean?

00:05:31.417 --> 00:05:34.083
Miss Tamano,
would you tell them what happened?

00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:35.000
Of course.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:40.208
Ever since I was little,
I've been raised by my grandparents

00:05:40.208 --> 00:05:42.958
in a village at the foot of a snowy mountain.

00:05:44.083 --> 00:05:45.917
<i>Oh, how beautiful.</i>

00:05:45.917 --> 00:05:48.250
<i>I've never seen someone so beautiful.</i>

00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:52.167
But something happened
soon after I turned 13.

00:05:52.417 --> 00:05:57.500
For some reason, marriage proposals
kept arriving almost every day.

00:05:58.583 --> 00:06:02.292
Even merchants and samurai
from faraway towns came to visit.

00:06:02.292 --> 00:06:04.000
<i>Miss Tamano will become my bride.</i>

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:07.167
<i>No, I will take good care of her.</i>

00:06:07.167 --> 00:06:12.917
I didn't want to leave the village,
so I declined all of them.

00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:16.667
However, one night...

00:06:36.667 --> 00:06:38.542
Tamano.

00:06:45.875 --> 00:06:51.083
Homura suddenly appeared, and dragged me
away to the snowy mountains.

00:06:51.417 --> 00:06:53.542
Dragged you away? What a jerk.

00:06:53.542 --> 00:06:54.417
Yes.

00:06:54.417 --> 00:06:56.333
But why would he do that?

00:06:56.917 --> 00:06:59.833
Because he wanted Miss Tamano
all to himself, obviously.

00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:01.375
All to himself?

00:07:05.042 --> 00:07:11.083
I was forced to live with him in his mansion
deep within the snowy mountains.

00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:16.292
Strangely, only Homura's mansion
didn't have any snow in it,

00:07:16.292 --> 00:07:18.417
and it always seemed like spring.

00:07:20.958 --> 00:07:22.083
At first,

00:07:22.458 --> 00:07:25.125
Homura treated me with warmth and kindness.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:29.167
EVIL MOUNTAIN GOD – HOMURA
He took very good care of me.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:31.750
But then...

00:07:39.542 --> 00:07:40.917
You!

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:43.875
How dare you look at my Tamano!

00:07:44.125 --> 00:07:47.208
Oh, no, I didn't mean...
Our eyes just met by chance.

00:07:47.208 --> 00:07:48.500
Unforgivable!

00:07:49.167 --> 00:07:50.583
H-Help me!

00:07:56.208 --> 00:08:01.125
Just for the reason that our eyes met,
Homura had killed the gardener.

00:08:01.542 --> 00:08:05.625
After that, he began to do the same to
all the guests who visited...

00:08:05.958 --> 00:08:09.417
Lord Homura, I've come to deliver
the goods that you ordered.

00:08:12.333 --> 00:08:13.583
Oh my, well.

00:08:15.125 --> 00:08:17.750
You! You dare gaze upon her!

00:08:18.958 --> 00:08:20.250
Please run!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.000
Lady Tamano.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.125
Was the meal not to your liking?

00:08:33.375 --> 00:08:35.542
Oh no, that wasn't...

00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:38.375
You! Unforgivable!

00:08:38.708 --> 00:08:39.625
Lord Homura!

00:08:39.917 --> 00:08:42.000
Tamano is mine!

00:08:42.667 --> 00:08:45.000
She belongs only to me!

00:08:47.792 --> 00:08:49.958
Please, stop this already.

00:08:49.958 --> 00:08:52.583
You're also to blame, Tamano.

00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:56.167
You must have behaved
in a way to lure them in.

00:08:56.625 --> 00:08:58.667
I would never do such a thing!

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:03.250
You might not be aware of it,
but you've been seducing all the men.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.292
Come with me!

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.792
Tamano, you belong only to me.

00:09:08.917 --> 00:09:11.792
I will never have anyone
look upon you ever again!

00:09:13.167 --> 00:09:17.083
Lord Homura, please!
Please don't keep me here.

00:09:17.083 --> 00:09:18.625
Lord Homura!

00:09:20.042 --> 00:09:23.167
Homura had locked me up in a jail cell.

00:09:23.917 --> 00:09:25.000
But...

00:09:39.417 --> 00:09:42.208
I was able to escape from the mansion,

00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:44.458
and when I was going down the mountain...

00:09:49.625 --> 00:09:54.542
That's when Lord Riku saved her.

00:09:56.667 --> 00:09:58.833
And that's how that story goes.

00:09:59.292 --> 00:10:00.833
I see.

00:10:01.167 --> 00:10:05.833
Well, it's not like I don't understand
Homura getting worried and jealous.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.750
But you know,
after you go through all that jealousy,

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.208
it kind of feels nice, doesn't it?

00:10:12.208 --> 00:10:14.125
What do you think, Lady Towa?

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:16.208
Huh, me?

00:10:16.208 --> 00:10:19.250
Is it like how I just can't
seem to let go of my smart phone?

00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:20.875
Like being addicted?

00:10:21.375 --> 00:10:23.125
Smart... what?

00:10:23.333 --> 00:10:25.458
What the heck are you saying?

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:26.500
Oh, um...

00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:28.167
It's nothing.

00:10:30.417 --> 00:10:35.125
But with someone so deeply jealous,
and if Riku took her in...

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:36.875
He's probably in grave danger.

00:10:37.208 --> 00:10:39.875
Yeah. You're gonna get killed by Homura.

00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:45.500
And that's why I've come here to ask you
to slay Homura in my stead.

00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:47.375
Slay Homura?

00:10:48.125 --> 00:10:50.458
But to ask them
to do something so dangerous...

00:10:50.458 --> 00:10:53.333
Homura is very powerful.

00:10:53.333 --> 00:10:56.500
You cannot put such
young ladies in danger...

00:10:56.667 --> 00:11:01.875
However, these princesses
are no ordinary young ladies.

00:11:03.042 --> 00:11:04.917
They are the Half-Demon Princesses.

00:11:05.375 --> 00:11:06.792
Half-Demon Princesses...

00:11:06.792 --> 00:11:10.000
Besides, they don't have a reason to refuse.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:15.583
It's the head of the evil mountain god—
his bounty will be tremendously high.

00:11:15.875 --> 00:11:16.875
What?

00:11:16.875 --> 00:11:20.000
And you won't have to clean
this place anymore.

00:11:20.458 --> 00:11:22.667
I'll do it! I'll definitely do it!

00:11:22.667 --> 00:11:26.167
Right? Setsuna and Towa,
you'll do it too, right? Right?

00:11:29.917 --> 00:11:33.458
I guess we got pressured
by Moroha and accepted the job, huh?

00:11:33.458 --> 00:11:34.542
CAT DEMON – KIRARA
Yeah.

00:11:34.542 --> 00:11:36.958
Well, three heads are better than one, right?

00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:41.250
But I didn't think I would
have to tag along, too.

00:11:41.917 --> 00:11:42.917
Brr!

00:11:47.917 --> 00:11:50.708
Tamano!

00:11:51.375 --> 00:11:54.042
Where did you go!

00:11:57.542 --> 00:11:58.875
So cold.

00:11:58.875 --> 00:12:01.625
I can't go any further, it's too cold.

00:12:03.333 --> 00:12:05.000
It's snowing so hard.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:08.042
I'm heading back. S-See you.

00:12:08.042 --> 00:12:11.250
Kirara, you can head back, too. Thank you.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:16.125
It's freezing! Where's the mansion?!

00:12:17.083 --> 00:12:18.167
I can sense it.

00:12:22.417 --> 00:12:24.208
There's no snow over in that area.

00:12:24.208 --> 00:12:25.000
Let's go.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.917
So cold.

00:12:27.333 --> 00:12:28.708
What's the matter?

00:12:29.708 --> 00:12:33.917
I'm just so worried about them.
I wonder if this was the right thing to do.

00:12:34.458 --> 00:12:38.417
If someone doesn't slay him, you'll never
be able to get away from him.

00:12:39.667 --> 00:12:44.083
No matter where you hide,
Homura will always find you.

00:12:44.583 --> 00:12:50.417
Well, I for one, would never understand
the love affairs of human beings.

00:12:54.125 --> 00:12:55.792
It's just like Miss Tamano said.

00:12:56.208 --> 00:12:58.083
It seems like spring here.

00:12:58.083 --> 00:12:59.833
– Yeah.
– Hey, look at that.

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:04.833
Tamano! Where are you?

00:13:05.208 --> 00:13:09.125
How dare you leave my side!
Where are you?!

00:13:09.458 --> 00:13:11.292
So that's the evil mountain god.

00:13:11.292 --> 00:13:12.375
Homura, huh?

00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:14.667
Charge!

00:13:14.667 --> 00:13:16.250
Whoa, hey, Moroha!

00:13:16.583 --> 00:13:18.250
Hey, Homura!

00:13:18.833 --> 00:13:21.375
Look all you want,
Miss Tamano's not here anymore!

00:13:21.792 --> 00:13:25.792
Geez, you don't think about
the consequences at all, do you?

00:13:26.833 --> 00:13:29.750
Are you the one who took away my Tamano?

00:13:30.042 --> 00:13:33.875
Hey! "My Tamano?"
She doesn't belong to you, okay?

00:13:33.875 --> 00:13:36.500
Shut up! Where is she?
Where is Tamano?

00:13:37.417 --> 00:13:39.375
Like we'd ever tell you.

00:13:39.375 --> 00:13:41.583
If you don't tell me...

00:13:44.958 --> 00:13:45.875
Moroha!

00:13:45.875 --> 00:13:48.958
Hot, hot! Hot!

00:13:52.917 --> 00:13:55.583
Don't underestimate my Robe of the Fire-rat!

00:13:55.583 --> 00:13:56.583
Where is she?

00:13:56.708 --> 00:14:00.083
Where is Tamano?
Tell me! Hurry up and tell me!

00:14:00.625 --> 00:14:02.500
Miss Tamano will never come back.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.458
What?

00:14:03.458 --> 00:14:05.083
Listen, Homura.

00:14:05.083 --> 00:14:09.000
You can't just keep someone at your side
without their consent...

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.250
That's just selfish!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.292
Shut up. Shut up!

00:14:18.375 --> 00:14:19.208
Those eyes...

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.750
Scourge of Swallows!

00:14:26.208 --> 00:14:27.542
I knew it was you two.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.792
The ones with the Gold and Silver Pearls...

00:14:33.167 --> 00:14:35.083
Then I <i>definitely </i>cannot...

00:14:38.458 --> 00:14:39.417
Towa!

00:14:40.417 --> 00:14:41.417
I'm fine.

00:14:41.958 --> 00:14:45.083
I didn't think you two would still be alive.

00:14:45.083 --> 00:14:46.417
What do you mean?

00:14:46.875 --> 00:14:48.583
Do you know us?

00:14:48.833 --> 00:14:51.333
You two... I could've sworn...

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.167
I had killed you both back then.

00:14:57.417 --> 00:14:58.625
<i>Homura.</i>

00:14:59.083 --> 00:15:01.458
<i>Burn that forest down.</i>

00:15:01.458 --> 00:15:02.417
<i>That forest?</i>

00:15:02.417 --> 00:15:04.542
BEAUTIFUL MYSTERY DEMON – ZER<i>O
That's fine by you, righ</i>t?

00:15:04.542 --> 00:15:06.417
<i>Lord Sesshomaru?</i>

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:09.500
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S FATHER –
SESSHOMARU

00:15:13.083 --> 00:15:15.042
<i>Burn the entire forest,</i>

00:15:15.042 --> 00:15:18.792
<i>and erase those cursed half-demon sisters </i>
<i>from the face of this world.</i>

00:15:18.792 --> 00:15:20.167
<i>Understood.</i>

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.167
<i>Setsuna, this way.</i>

00:15:22.417 --> 00:15:23.792
<i>Sis.</i>

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.042
<i>Sis!</i>

00:15:28.917 --> 00:15:33.292
I thought I had burned everything down.

00:15:33.875 --> 00:15:37.083
But for both of you sisters to have survived...

00:15:37.083 --> 00:15:38.958
Then that means, you're...

00:15:38.958 --> 00:15:43.250
Yes, I was the one who
burned down that forest.

00:15:44.583 --> 00:15:46.042
Because of you...

00:15:46.792 --> 00:15:48.083
Because of you...

00:15:48.708 --> 00:15:50.833
<i>Setsuna!</i>

00:15:52.583 --> 00:15:56.125
<i>Setsuna!</i>

00:15:57.667 --> 00:15:59.375
Setsuna and I...

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.583
were torn apart at that forest!

00:16:02.583 --> 00:16:05.583
CORPSE DEALER

00:16:06.583 --> 00:16:07.583
Going somewhere?

00:16:08.875 --> 00:16:10.167
Mister Riku.

00:16:10.333 --> 00:16:13.417
Even if you go, it's not like
you can change anything.

00:16:13.417 --> 00:16:14.333
I understand.

00:16:15.083 --> 00:16:20.000
But I need to be the one to
settle things with Homura.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:23.458
I can't put those girls
in danger because of me.

00:16:25.542 --> 00:16:26.833
Well, then.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:30.792
If you want to go that badly,
then I'll accompany you.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:35.083
There's something I want to see for myself.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.000
You called for me, Lord Riku?

00:16:41.417 --> 00:16:43.625
Boy, it was freezing over there.

00:16:43.625 --> 00:16:46.667
Sorry Takechiyo, but could you
make another trip there?

00:16:46.667 --> 00:16:48.000
What, again?

00:16:48.167 --> 00:16:53.042
Um, I mean, if it's for you, Lord Riku,
then there's no problem at all.

00:16:53.042 --> 00:16:54.292
All right, Miss Tamano.

00:16:54.292 --> 00:16:55.375
O-Okay.

00:17:00.208 --> 00:17:03.083
I'm in trouble if they find out
about you two!

00:17:03.083 --> 00:17:06.167
I can't let you live!

00:17:10.208 --> 00:17:11.458
Homura!

00:17:15.125 --> 00:17:19.083
I'll send anyone who tries to tear
me and Tamano apart to the next life!

00:17:19.375 --> 00:17:21.208
You're the one who tore <i>us </i>apart!

00:17:21.542 --> 00:17:23.333
Cyclone Burst!

00:17:26.625 --> 00:17:27.708
Do you think...

00:17:27.958 --> 00:17:30.458
you can defeat me with that?

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:36.500
Oh, no.

00:17:37.708 --> 00:17:39.125
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:17:43.875 --> 00:17:44.833
Moroha!

00:17:51.458 --> 00:17:54.542
We can't get swallowed into that.
Let's retreat for now.

00:17:54.958 --> 00:17:58.667
No! I need to defeat Homura
no matter what.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.042
He's the one
who tore me and Setsuna apart.

00:18:03.417 --> 00:18:04.333
Towa.

00:18:04.333 --> 00:18:07.042
Then make sure you dodge it. Here it comes!

00:18:07.583 --> 00:18:11.167
This time, I'll turn you to ash.

00:18:11.167 --> 00:18:13.333
Lord Homura, please stop!

00:18:14.333 --> 00:18:15.375
Tamano.

00:18:15.375 --> 00:18:16.542
Tamano, is that you?

00:18:16.917 --> 00:18:21.042
Lord Homura, please stop this already.
These girls have nothing to do with this.

00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:25.667
I don't care about that.
Who the hell is that guy with you, huh?!

00:18:28.125 --> 00:18:29.917
Why, you!

00:18:30.458 --> 00:18:33.250
Hey, you're making him even angrier!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:38.708
See, Miss Tamano? Don't you think
you should return to his side?

00:18:38.708 --> 00:18:41.208
No, I will never do that!

00:18:42.625 --> 00:18:45.458
B-But Tamano,
why would you say such a thing?

00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:48.208
I'll say it as many times as I need to.

00:18:48.208 --> 00:18:50.708
I will live by myself, without you.

00:18:51.083 --> 00:18:54.000
I will never return to you!

00:18:55.125 --> 00:18:57.708
Yeah, you tell him, Miss Tamano.

00:18:57.708 --> 00:19:02.208
Did Miss Tamano
risk her life just to come here?

00:19:02.833 --> 00:19:04.875
Just so she can break up with him.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:12.542
What has happened to you, Tamano?
No one can ever tear our love apart.

00:19:12.542 --> 00:19:17.292
You're just being swayed by him.
Tamano, come back to me.

00:19:17.292 --> 00:19:19.458
Now, come!

00:19:19.458 --> 00:19:21.250
Well? Why not go to him?

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:23.250
No! I will not return!

00:19:23.458 --> 00:19:25.500
Tamano!

00:19:27.417 --> 00:19:33.708
Why? Why would you say that?
Even though I love you this much...

00:19:33.708 --> 00:19:38.583
Don't you understand my love for you?

00:19:42.458 --> 00:19:43.625
Hot, hot!

00:19:43.625 --> 00:19:46.125
Whoa. Please be careful.

00:19:46.417 --> 00:19:47.500
Yes.

00:19:47.792 --> 00:19:50.208
Stop it!

00:19:50.208 --> 00:19:52.375
Tamano is mine!

00:19:52.375 --> 00:19:54.917
My love for her is the greatest!

00:19:54.917 --> 00:19:56.792
Tamano! Tamano!

00:19:57.208 --> 00:20:00.750
Tamano!

00:20:03.125 --> 00:20:05.542
Whoa, he's <i>mad </i>mad now.

00:20:10.167 --> 00:20:13.625
That Homura. He's burning himself up.

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:18.542
Tamano...

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:19.792
Tamano...

00:20:20.375 --> 00:20:21.208
Tamano...

00:20:26.958 --> 00:20:29.500
Hey, we have to run, and fast.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.542
Towa.

00:20:31.542 --> 00:20:32.542
Towa!

00:20:32.542 --> 00:20:33.667
Setsuna.

00:20:33.667 --> 00:20:34.542
Let's go.

00:20:34.542 --> 00:20:35.417
But...

00:20:35.417 --> 00:20:36.500
Come on!

00:20:47.625 --> 00:20:52.583
<i>How utterly absurd. Nothing good </i>
<i>comes from loving a human being.</i>

00:20:53.417 --> 00:20:57.042
<i>Not for the Great Dog-Demon,</i>
<i> nor for Sesshomaru.</i>

00:20:57.958 --> 00:20:59.625
<i>Nothing but destruction.</i>

00:21:02.083 --> 00:21:05.167
I cannot thank you all enough
for your help.

00:21:05.167 --> 00:21:07.625
Takechiyo can fly you to where you want.

00:21:07.625 --> 00:21:11.875
Why are you the one offering?
But really, it's no problem for me.

00:21:12.417 --> 00:21:14.750
No, this is fine.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:18.458
Now you can live with
your grandparents peacefully again.

00:21:18.458 --> 00:21:22.917
Yes. I will return to my grandparents
at the foot of the mountain.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:26.167
Well, everyone,
please take care of yourselves.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:31.000
That Homura, damn him.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:35.708
The bastard got so angry
he burned himself straight into ash!

00:21:36.208 --> 00:21:39.125
And thanks to that, my bounty... gone...

00:21:39.125 --> 00:21:41.542
It's too bad, Moroha.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.208
As for me, I think I'm done
walking around with this.

00:21:49.917 --> 00:21:54.542
It's not like I can contact anyone,
and I have Setsuna with me here.

00:21:55.708 --> 00:21:56.750
What?

00:21:56.875 --> 00:21:58.208
Are you feeling better?

00:22:01.625 --> 00:22:03.250
About what?

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:05.125
I see.

00:22:05.958 --> 00:22:07.000
It's fine.

00:23:43.042 --> 00:23:44.583
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.583 --> 00:23:47.292
As the Half-Demon Princesses
were taking their first breaths,

00:23:47.833 --> 00:23:50.333
a great cataclysm was approaching.

00:23:50.333 --> 00:23:55.042
Lord Sesshomaru and Inuyasha rose
to prevent this tragedy, but...

00:23:55.042 --> 00:23:57.583
Why have you awoken me?

00:23:57.583 --> 00:24:00.250
This is a keepsake from Inuyasha's mother.

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:03.000
We decided that if we had a girl,
we would give this to her.

00:24:03.333 --> 00:24:07.417
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"Farewell Under the Lunar Eclipse"

00:24:07.417 --> 00:24:23.979
Lord Sesshomaru, I have faith in you.
